bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Favourite Manga Page (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control UserController
control UserService
control JwtService
entity ":UserModel" as UserModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open favourite list
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /favourites
activate Router

Router -> UserController: 3. getFavourites()
activate UserController

UserController -> UserService: 4. getFavourites(token)
activate UserService

UserService -> UserService: 5. Check token
activate UserService
space
deactivate UserService

opt No token
    UserService --> UserController: 5.1. Return 400 Bad Request
    UserController --> Router: 5.2. Return 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 5.3. Return 400 Bad Request
    UI --> User: 5.4. Show error
end

UserService -> JwtService: 6. Verify token
activate JwtService
JwtService --> UserService: 7. Decoded
deactivate JwtService

UserService -> UserService: 8. Check decoded
activate UserService
space
deactivate UserService

opt Invalid token
    UserService --> UserController: 8.1. Return 400 Bad Request
    UserController --> Router: 8.2. Return 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 8.3. Return 400 Bad Request
    UI --> User: 8.4. Show error
end

UserService -> UserModel: 9. Find user
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 10. Find user
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 11. Reuturn user
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 12. User data
deactivate UserModel

UserService -> UserService: 13. Check user
activate UserService
space
deactivate UserService

opt User not found
    UserService --> UserController: 13.1. Return 400 Bad Request
    UserController --> Router: 13.2. Return 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 13.3. Return 400 Bad Request
    UI --> User: 13.4. Show error
end

UserService --> UserController: 14. Return favourites list
deactivate UserService

UserController --> Router: 15. HTTP response
deactivate UserController

Router --> UI: 16. Render favourites
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 17. Display favourite mangas
deactivate UI
deactivate User